's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"b6e2bd004611c5bcf99fa37f9d2c4bc9","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"9a6fdcf0c2bf12f4811cb35aa003d8af","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"6f16f3fe53e74ff60c8fbf3ed617f546","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"a1addceaa685fa718ceb59513663c9e4","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"a71f0482edd588f8292c5e443a3c4a78","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"b5c9d1c563cf099fdf7212c695ebf3fa","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"23311305c2a0b73b61e1607b81aeb52d","originalFileName":"6386a403-f40b-482a-ba9f-2283f45dc4fa-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b5f5318b